                       <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="line-height: 200%; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;">深证上〔<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>〕<span lang="EN-US">1135</span>号<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 200%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 200%;"><a name="Day2"></a><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;">各市场参与人：<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;">为表达对江泽民同志的无比崇敬和深切悼念之情，根据中国证监会公告，本所定于<span lang="EN-US">2022</span>年<span lang="EN-US">12</span>月<span lang="EN-US">6</span>日上午江泽民同志追悼大会默哀期间，临时停市<span lang="EN-US">3</span>分钟，默哀结束后恢复交易。<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;">临时停市期间，本所所有证券、期权交易暂停，临时停市结束后恢复交易。具体安排参照本所证券、期权交易规则临时停牌、复牌的有关规定执行。请各市场参与人密切关注本所发布的有关信息。<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 200%;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;">特此通知。<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
